# Wave W17-P (Route 116): echo turf — quiet hill grass: a hushed sage green going still as the woods thin and the hill thickens, pale quiet flecks scattered in it like held breath (design: calm speckled grass on a quiet thickening hill; the HUSHLET begin here). Route 116’s own ground — paler and quieter than Route 117’s loud field green beside it, and split from Route 110’s warm pillar-shadow meadow by temperature: this grass is cool and listening, not sun-warmed.
